{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/293368b7b74b24e84ca162a2926fdacc.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Exodus is an online co-op horror game featuring proximity voice chat, a shared team arsenal, and terrifying monsters. You and up to 5 friends can explore dangerous maps to harvest valuable Biomass using your specialized Net-Launchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/55ad2e4ed9f606e08f97bbc795bfa43c.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/e0fdb8ca97d947459acf9386bc5a0204.poster.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/e0fdb8ca97d947459acf9386bc5a0204.webm?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/e0fdb8ca97d947459acf9386bc5a0204.mp4?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth isn't what it used to be. After the war that forced humanity to flee, the local fauna mutated into horrible beings. Explore unique maps harboring monsters of all kinds. Your job is to hunt them. They're terrifying, ridiculous, and most importantly, a potent source of Biomass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/0469a9c2d6405193ed35fb55b3d5a3a9.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/059f5988dae8bef9b6d78a3695b29924.poster.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/059f5988dae8bef9b6d78a3695b29924.webm?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/059f5988dae8bef9b6d78a3695b29924.mp4?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in space isn't free. While &quot;The Ark&quot; desperately needs Biomass to survive, <i>your</i> paycheck comes from the strange Artifacts left behind. Your mission: Meet the Biomass quota to save humanity... and sell every Artifact you find to get paid.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/7384ceef850620e793bfb0e5d62c54e5.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/b763ebff6e6545ffa8a72c957659b35c.poster.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/b763ebff6e6545ffa8a72c957659b35c.webm?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/b763ebff6e6545ffa8a72c957659b35c.mp4?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The basic Net-Launcher is courtesy of the Ark, but you won't last long with it. Invest your profits in new Net <i>firmware</i> (Electric, Heavy...). Thanks to the Ark's data network, when one crew member unlocks a net, the <strong>entire team</strong> gets access. Combine different types to hunt efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/2829209d152fea5b7f36cda8e3dea375.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/c2de4c150107afbdd7dd0420388daf93.poster.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/c2de4c150107afbdd7dd0420388daf93.webm?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/c2de4c150107afbdd7dd0420388daf93.mp4?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your paycheck comes from Artifacts, so spend it wisely at the Cave's shop. Buy vital items like medkits, flashlights or even decoys. This gear is essential to survive long enough to extract with even <i>more</i> artifacts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/45bdb50e55bd28f845a7b4f75a9ff50f.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/a0e38e9936a1dfaba3611646a8ce6437.poster.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/a0e38e9936a1dfaba3611646a8ce6437.webm?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/a0e38e9936a1dfaba3611646a8ce6437.mp4?t=1762564235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ark doesn't waste resources. If your main unit is destroyed, your consciousness chip activates a backup &quot;Mini-bot.&quot; You can't hunt, but you can <i>help</i>: light the way, distract threats, or just scream over voice chat while you run. But beware: this second chance is your last. If that little tin can is destroyed, your signal is lost forever... (well, at least until the crew gets back to the Cave).</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149590?t=1762564235","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4149590?t=1762564235","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/d686c844c84e4e88fd80807bd2b48f122698af41/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762564235","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/d686c844c84e4e88fd80807bd2b48f122698af41/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762564235","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/extras/293368b7b74b24e84ca162a2926fdacc.avif?t=1762564235\" width=616 height=347 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Project Exodus is an online co-op horror game featuring