64235\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Ark doesn't waste resources. If your main unit is destroyed, your consciousness chip activates a backup &quot;Mini-bot.&quot; You can't hunt, but you can <i>help</i>: light the way, distract threats, or just scream over voice chat while you run. But beware: this second chance is your last. If that little tin can is destroyed, your signal is lost forever... (well, at least until the crew gets back to the Cave).</p>","developers":["Astrox"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/5715486455987fd5da2d52f1293b502b000b654a/header.jpg?t=1762564235","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Project Exodus","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel(R) Core(TM) i5-1035G1 CPU @ 1.00GHz 1.19 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel(R) UHD Graphics (128 MB)<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX Compatible Sound Card.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700K (3.61 GHz)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3070 Ti<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</stro