62564235","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4149590/fcb3dc6a36aa1138f77f5a5caaaa3e35d548d6e6/ss_fcb3dc6a36aa1138f77f5a5caaaa3e35d548d6e6.600x338.jpg?t=1762564235"}],"short_description":"A co-op horror game for up to 6 players in which you must hunt monsters and convert them into biomass to meet the quota for &quot;The Ark&quot;. Collect artifacts, earn money, and buy upgrades to improve your chances of survival.","steam_appid":4149590,"support_info":{"email":"dev.astrox@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English","type":"game","website":null}